        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy Wan 2.2 T2V A14B\n\nGenerate a video on Comfy Cloud with the official Wan 2.2 T2V A14B template. Requires COMFY_API_KEY and model availability on Comfy Cloud.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete Wan 2.2 T2V A14B graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its generated video.\n\n**Try this:** Change text on CLIP Text Encode (Positive Prompt) and run again to compare results. Edit the visible nodes to change settings.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/benchmarks/video_wan2_2_14B_t2v.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
